{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後Pの最新ブログにひめたん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあ新制服(＊><＊)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/05/22/6952282/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏服です！半袖！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青と白の2種類あって\nひめたんほんとは青だと思うんだけど\nとりあえず白バージョン＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルのお稽古も頑張りながら\n絶賛制作期間中でもあり\nばたばた、ばたばた、ばたばた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんななか 9thのMV撮ってきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんに公開されるのはいつになるのやら。\n楽しみにしててねー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日記書くの遅くなっちゃった\nほんとにごめんね( >_< )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって最近ほんとに\nお稽古してるーくらいしか\n報告することないんだもーん(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！\nそいえば明日取材していただきます\n今度の日記で告知すーるねー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃーあー今日は書くことないから\n久々にみんなに質問するね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくよ⊂二二二（　＾ω＾）二⊃ぶーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/05/22/6952282/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのこと好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/05/22/6952282/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今わんちゃん飼ったとしたら\n何て名前つける？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/05/22/6952282/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おすすめの本あったら教えて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後の質問は\nちょっと前にも聞いたかもだけど\n最近ますます本を読みたいなーて\n思ってるのー(＾ω＾)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、これまじでリストアップしたいから\n改めて聞かせてー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わんちゃんの性別はまかせますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"移動時間って\n何して過ごすのが有意義なんだろうね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋の待ち時間は\nお勉強とかできるけど\n移動中はそーゆわけにもいかないからね......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/05/22/6952282/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みおちゃんひめちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"口笛吹けるようになりたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"口笛マスター！ひめたんに伝授して！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーさっきテレビで\nカーペンターズさんの曲流れてきたのね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん中学生の英語の時間に\nカーペンターズさん聴いてたから\nなんだか懐かしい気持ちになったのと同時に\nちょっと寂しい(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/05/22/6952282/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/05/22/6952282/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん緊張をほぐすために\nしてることとかあるの？？\nありきたりですが\n人っててのひらに3回書いて飲み込む\n小学生の頃からやってます\nああ書くの恥ずかしいな(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/05/22/6952282/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はじめて個別行きました。\nかわいすぎてやばかった。\nひめきゅんになっていいですか？\nようこそ＼(^O^)／きゅんきゅん王国へ\n仲良くしてねーよろしくね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/05/22/6952282/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピラフとチャーハンの違いを教えてよひめたん\nピーマン入ってたらピラフで\nピーマン入ってなかったらチャーハン？\nわからんけど\nひめたんはピラフはあんま好きくないけど\nチャーハンは好きです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/05/22/6952282/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ところで、ひめたんは朝型？夜型？\n早起きが得意な夜型です\nつまりお昼寝必須なタイプ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/05/22/6952282/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこでひめたんに聞きたいのですが、\n一体あなたは誰のものなんですか？\nひめたんが聞きたいよ\nひめたんは誰のものなのよ\n教えて(＊^^＊)ひめたんわかんないにゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/05/22/6952282/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの日記の\nコメント欄下２ケタに46を踏んだ方へ\n手書きでコメ返するコーナー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ ひめたん46 ／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/05/22/6952282/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもたくさんのコメント\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"森と林の違い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん知ってる？\n人の手が加えられたのが林で\nそうじゃないのが森なんだって！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごーい(゜゜)(゜゜)(゜゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとすごいほんとすごいすごい\n言われてみればそうかもね\nうんうんそんな気する！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のひめたん従順(゜゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とげとげひめたん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/05/22/6952282/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/05/22/6952282/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が好きなみなさん\nごめんなさいねーんふふふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はあまえんぼさんもーどみたーい\nみんなーすきすきーだいすきー\nんふふんふふふすんふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"疲れてんのかな、寝よーっと(＊´・ω・＊)"}],"source":"archive"}